# Canonical TCP malformed cases (RFC 9293 header / IANA TCP option rules).
# tcp-invalid-data-offset: data offset nibble 3 (<5 words) is rejected before any
# field is trusted; tcp-truncated-after-ipv4: a well-formed IPv4 header (total
# length matches the buffer) encloses a TCP segment cut short of the 20-byte
# fixed header; tcp-option-length-underflow / tcp-option-overrun /
# tcp-option-fixed-length-mismatch drive TcpOption::decode_all directly.
tcp-invalid-data-offset|ipv4|invalid-field-value|tcp.data_offset|450000280000000040060000c0000201c00002021f90005000000001000000023002ffff00000000
tcp-truncated-after-ipv4|ipv4|buffer-too-short|tcp header|450000240000000040060000c0000201c00002020035005000000000000000005002ffff
